  "title": "Cyber Insurance Accumulation & PML Modeler",
  "description": "Estimate portfolio-level cyber insurance Probable Maximum Loss (PML) at multiple return periods by scenario type, using published industry severity curves by sector and coverage trigger (IBM/Ponemon 2024, FBI IC3 2024) and Lloyd's RDS 2024 systemic PML scalars. Computes attritional expected loss, systemic PML by return period, combined PML upper bound, loss-ratio stress, and an accumulation alert at >25% of the aggregate limit. Client-side. Works offline. Zero PII; synthetic aggregate inputs only.",
